# Exclude everything, then admit each item. The last matching pattern wins,
# so later exclusions are restated after the negations.
#
# Admit the license generator and production build inputs. The program embeds
# docker/build-driver.sh and docker/install-build-kit.sh at compile time.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!web
!docker
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!tools
tools/*
!tools/third-party-licenses.py
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/blob-report
target
